      "text": {
        "en": "Most pet owners praise Dr Luevano, Dr Aderholt, and the nursing assistants for their warmth, thorough explanations, and patient manner. Clients appreciate that staff make both puppies and nervous rescue animals feel safe during examinations. While one reviewer found a clinician somewhat aloof, the vast majority describe a supportive and welcoming team."
