      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle care for reactive pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents frequently observe that the veterinary team handles reactive dogs, young puppies, and cautious cats with immense patience. Reviewers note that technicians offer treats, take time to build trust, and adjust handling techniques to keep appointments low-stress. Owners feel reassured leaving pets for diagnostics and routine care."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "waiting",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 7,
      "title": {
        "en": "Same-day delays and booking constraints"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Several reviewers highlight quick check-ins, punctuality, and helpful weekend availability for scheduled consultations. However, multiple clients express frustration when seeking same-day or urgent care for sick pets, noting that appointments fill up quickly across the app. Pet owners suggest booking routine wellness visits early to secure convenient slots."
      }
    }
